From: UN1CA <unica@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Trial expanded Dual Recording resolutions and frame rates

Remove the integrated vertical-only default-resolution dimmer. Add dedicated
FHD60/UHD60 menu commands and preserve 60fps in vertical recording geometry.
Keep the bounded 1920x2160 preview and all existing enum ordinals/IDs. Append
two vertical60 resolution values and two command values; no old value moves.
Reuse stock vertical bitrate profiles for the new output IDs in this trial.
Existing method register counts and exception/switch structures are preserved.
The shared dedicated Dual Recording menu/output path also gains these options.
Experimental: provider, compositor and encoded-file validation required.
Do not combine with donor camera nodes or treat offline build as runtime proof.

